# Mandatory validation commands for this repository.
#
# cplx is a Bash project. It carries no pyproject.toml, no tests/ tree, no
# check.bat and no GROUNDHOG.md, so the built-in `ghog day` default walks a
# check step that skips and a pytest step that exits 5. Since the resolver has
# no removal operation, inheriting that default made a complete validation floor
# unreachable here whatever the work proved.
#
# What belongs in this file is what every review of this repository must prove,
# for as long as the repository exists. It is NOT the place for one effort's
# checks: a plan adds those to the resolved set itself, as plan additions, and
# they retire when the effort does. A version-scoped command declared here would
# outlive its own plan and bind reviews that have nothing to do with it.
#
# So the floor is the lint gate, and only the lint gate. It is what this project
# substitutes for the check.bat a Python project would carry, and it keeps the
# property the built-in default protects: one command runs the gate over
# everything it covers and stops non-green at the first finding.
#
# These are mandatory for this repository. Plan and request additions are added
# to them and can never subtract from them.

bash src/utils/lint_shell.sh
